+Optional `startup_loop` object:
+
+* May be omitted when the app has not detected repeated startup exits.
+* `schema` must be `1`.
+* `count` must be one of `2`, `3`, or `4p`.
+* `window_age` must be one of `na`, `s`, `m`, `h`, or `d`.
+* Treat this as an alerting hint for repeated launch-time exits, not as a
+  stable user or device identifier.
+* Reject exact timestamps, install IDs, account identifiers, device
+  identifiers, raw process names, raw exception text, stack text, and
+  free-form strings.
+
